            "P5-L066",
            "P5-L067"
          ],
          "exact_native_text": "NOTE: Extraterritorial fees shall be applied when a plan review and an inspection is requested for projects \noutside the City of Colorado Springs’ jurisdiction. In addition to all applicable fees, a one-time surcharge \nshall be assessed based on the inspector’s travel-time and roundtrip mileage. Mileage shall be calculated \nusing each city’s center point, as referenced on Google Maps. Mileage shall be calculated at the current \nInternal Revenue Service’s (IRS) standard mileage rate. Surcharges will be rounded to the nearest dollar. \n",
