          ],
          "exact_native_text": "Construction Plan Check Fee: This fee will be collected by Pikes Peak Regional Building Department (PPRBD) \nupon plans being submitted through PPRBD’s plan portal.  This fee equates to a limited review, which is \nthe smallest amount that CSFD will charge for review of a construction plan set.  If a full review and \ninspection is required for the project, then the plan check fee will be deducted from the total fee charged \nat time of CSFD plan approval.   \n",
