            "P6-L033",
            "P6-L034",
            "P6-L035"
          ],
          "exact_native_text": "Performance Based Design Surcharge: A one-time fee to establish fire safety and engineering goals and \nobjectives, fire model construction and evaluation, plan review, inspection, acceptance testing, and re-\nevaluation of all performance-based designs, alternative materials and methods or other design \nalternatives when requested or at the plan reviewer’s discretion based on project scope.  In all cases the \nminimum fee shall be $2,000.  \n",
